# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Okuphumayo bhala: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: ([''] tccompare: ['']), umugqa-omusha.
